This '''species''' was a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] that existed in [[the galaxy]].<ref name="TFA" />

==Biology and appearance==
This sentient species was distinguished by their hairless heads, downturned [[mouth]]s, and [[Color|tan]] skin. They also had unique goggles with large, red, bulging lenses.<ref name="TFA" />

==Species in the galaxy==
[[File:Unidentified-Bald-Species-Concept.jpg|thumb|right|200px|Concept art by Ivan Manzella]]
In [[9 ABY]],<ref name="TBOBF Date">{{BoBFDate}}</ref> a member of this species was present in [[Mos Espa]] on the [[planet]] [[Tatooine]] shortly after [[Mayor]] [[Mok Shaiz]]'s [[Mok Shaiz's majordomo|majordomo]] was [[Chase through Mos Espa|chased down]] by [[Mods|members]] of the [[Fett gotra]].<ref name="TBOBF">{{BOBF|Chapter 3: The Streets of Mos Espa}}</ref> Around that same time<ref name="SC Date">{{SkeletonCrewDate}}</ref> another member of this species could be found eating at [[Borgo Prime|Port Borgo]].<ref name="SC">{{SkeletonCrew|Way, Way Out Past the Barrier}}</ref> Later, in [[34 ABY]],<ref name="TFA Date">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]''</ref> at least three members of this species could be found dwelling in [[Maz Kanata]]'s [[Takodana Castle|castle]].<ref name="TFA" />

==Behind the scenes==
The species made their debut in the [[2015]] film ''[[Star Wars: Episode VII The Force Awakens]]'', directed by [[J.J. Abrams]].<ref name="TFA" /> This species was originally designed by concept artist [[Ivan Manzella]].<ref name="Manzella">{{WebCite|url=https://www.krop.com/ivanmanzella|text=Creatures & Character Designs|work=[[Ivan Manzella]]'s [https://www.krop.com/ivanmanzella official website]|archivedate=20190121223617}}</ref>

